      "id": "dahan-c1",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "二十四节气按太阳位置划分一年。",
        "en": "The 24 solar terms divide the year by the Sun's position."
      },
      "region": [
        "中国"
      ],
      "period": "现行口径（GB/T 33661-2017 时代）；机制承自传统历法",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-pmo-almanac-qa",
        "source-hko-solar-terms"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
        "sci-solarterms-calendar-role"
      ],
      "reviewer": "aiwindyjm",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "dahan-c2",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "大寒是第二十四个也是最后一个节气。太阳到达黄经300°，一年将终。",
        "en": "Dahan is the twenty-fourth and final term: the Sun reaches 300°. The cycle nears completion."
      },
      "region": [
        "全球（黄经定义与地域无关）；日期经验因纬度而异"
      ],
      "period": "现代天文学口径；2017年起有国家标准表述",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-ihchina-dahan-feature",
        "source-xinhua-dahan-topic"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
        "sci-dahan-longitude-300"
      ],
      "reviewer": "aiwindyjm",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "dahan-c3",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "大寒是农历十二月的\"中气\"。过了大寒，又是立春。",
        "en": "Dahan is the final mid-term of the twelfth lunar month. After Dahan comes Lichun again."
      },
      "region": [
        "全球（黄经定义与地域无关）；日期经验因纬度而异"
      ],
      "period": "现代天文学口径；2017年起有国家标准表述",
      "source_ids": [
        "source-ihchina-dahan-feature",
        "source-xinhua-dahan-topic"
      ],
      "knowledge_ids": [
        "sci-dahan-longitude-300"
      ],
      "reviewer": "aiwindyjm",
      "reviewed_at": "2026-09-28"
    },
    {
      "id": "dahan-c4",
      "kind": "scientific-explanation",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "最深的寒冷。但白昼已经在变长，春天不远了。",
        "en": "The deepest cold. Yet days are already longer — spring is near."
      },
      "region": [
        "中国（1991-2020年全国统计与南北分区）"
      ],
      "period": "现代气象统计口径（1991-2020年；媒体稿2016/2023）",
